*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (1,000%) spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 0.07~10 seconds<sup>2f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (1,250%) spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 0.07~8 seconds<sup>2f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (1,500%) spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 0.07~5.33 seconds<sup>2f~160f</sup>.
